     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Crown Court 3 is the smallest piece in our Castle Crest series, a single castle tower in Knight Blue and Baby Blue with a pointed spire canopy and one straight slide. Seen from above, the play deck is octagonal, so children can step onto it from more than one side. It suits children aged 3 to 9, and play centres on climbing up and sliding down. The listing gives a capacity of 15 children and a product area of 9'2\" x 12'5\". With a safe play area of 15'2\" x 18'5\", it fits easily into a society garden or a nursery corner. Crown Court 3 carries a 3-year warranty on galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Share your site photos and we will place it on a layout drawing."
     }
    ]
